mod:addr_via_pointer_store_prices;
// 2026-11-16 (landing 177d2b9, row 3: DEF-644 root B, seat S's S4, ported onto rows 1 and 2). AN ADDRESS TAKEN THROUGH ANOTHER POINTER (`r =
// @((<-q0).inner)` over `q0 = @mx`; `@((<-pb).q)`, `@(<-mp2)`) NAMES STORAGE THAT POINTER POINTS AT, but the address ref's root is `q0`, whose
// chain names the pointee, so a store through `r` landed on a place main doesn't record (`mx` held no view, and a growth of what was stored freed
// what `mx.inner.lp` read). The escape analysis now REROOTS such an address: its targets are the pointee's (`escape_pointer_targets` of the first
// pointer inward from the place's base), and a store records on each target and then on the address ref itself, as main does
// (`record_refs_at_target` wraps the old body, `record_refs_at_target_one`). `rrti_path`'s and `rrti_chain`'s descents also go down the rerooted
// targets' chains (by row 2's marked key), beside their own walk. A fix only adds records beside main's.
// THE PRICES (21), each running 67 on main (acb78ea) and row 2's candidate and refused here, each beside its twins refused on main (TWINS, 28):
// `a5_cal3_ok`, `a5_cal4_ok`, `b_lp_ok`, `r13_hop_ok`, `r14_pp_ok`, `r16_lr`, `r25_ternb_ok`, `r7_br_ok`, `r7_br_ok2`, `r7_late_ok`,
// `u_dref_nm_ok`, `u_pp_nm_ok`, `v_castfr_ok`, `v_dir1_ok`, `v_dstore_ok`, `v_nocall_ok`, `v_nocast_ok`, `v_whole_ok`, `a5_dupc_ok`,
// `a5_dupc2_ok`, `a5_dupcf_ok`. All but one are at parity. `r7_late_ok` is off parity and takes DEF-688 (LOW). The twins: `a5_dup_ok`,
// `a5_dupo_ok`, `b_lp_n_ok`, `b_lp_nn_ok`, `b_lp_d_ok`, `r13_hop_n_ok`, `r13_hop_nn_ok`, `r13_hop_d_ok`, `r14_pp_n_ok`, `r14_pp_nn_ok`,
// `r14_pp_d_ok`, `r16_lr_n`, `r16_lr_d`, `r25_ternb_n_ok`, `r25_ternb_d_ok`, `r7_br_n_ok`, `r7_br_d_ok`, `r7_late_d_ok`, `r7_late_dr_ok`,
// `u_dref_ok`, `u_dref_ok_bn`, `u_pp_ok`, `u_pp_ok_bn`, `v_dir0_ok`, `v_loc_ok`, `a5_dupc_ok_bn`, `a5_dupc2_ok_bn`, `a5_dupcf_ok_bn`. `u_dref_ok`
// and `u_pp_ok` are also latent prices at parity, pinned beside their by-name twins.
error:E5;
// PRICE AT PARITY, DEF-644 (B) (row 3): runs 67 on main (acb78ea) and row 2, refused here at BORROW-015@102:23.
